        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make pizza on  Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make lots of slices and fill orders one after another!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your slice stock full and serve orders, but don't let anything burn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake masterfully and aim for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Rules》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pizzas to order and serve them to your customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn the most points, prepare perfect pizzas and don't let them burn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake as many pizzas as you can within the time limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《How to Play》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Place pizza dough on the counter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Roll out the dough and add toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Bake the pizza in the oven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. When the pizza is done, cut it and stock the slices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Pick 4 slices to box, then serve them to the customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a high spot on the global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pizzas quickly and accurately, fulfill more and more orders, and aim for a new record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be faster and more precise than your opponents to win!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make pizza on  Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make lots of slices and fill orders one after another!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your slice stock full and serve orders, but don't let anything burn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake masterfully and aim for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Rules》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pizzas to order and serve them to your customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn the most points, prepare perfect pizzas and don't let them burn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake as many pizzas as you can within the time limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《How to Play》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Place pizza dough on the counter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Roll out the dough and add toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Bake the pizza in the oven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. When the pizza is done, cut it and stock the slices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Pick 4 slices to box, then serve them to the customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a high spot on the global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pizzas quickly and accurately, fulfill more and more orders, and aim for a new record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be faster and more precise than your opponents to win!</p>",
